{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1382045-full-metal-mage","id":1382045,"title":"Full Metal Mage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-16T20:14:58-07:00","id":1382045,"title":"Full Metal Mage","content":"One of the other players in my Cabal expressed her interest to be an Alchemist ala FMA. Her initial choice of Path is Obrimos, being drawn to 2E's description of the Path as rigorously logical and scientific. When she explained the rough character concept, the ST and I both felt that this goals might better be achieved through a focus in Matter Arcana, which she could still get as her tertiary Arcanum along side Forces and Prime if she stays Obrimos. Would it be more advisable for her to switch to Moros to achieve this concept? They are called Alchemists after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26087-zenbear","name":"ZenBear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T20:25:41-07:00","id":1382048,"title":"","content":"Edward is both an explorer and scientist. Most of his transmutations involve inorganic materials and energy. So I think the Celestial Masters would suit this purpose:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Celestial_Masters_(MTAw)\" target=\"_blank\">https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Ce..._Masters_(MTAw)</a><br /> <br /> A 2ed conversion can be found here:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e/page6\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ed-to-2e/page6</a><br /> <br /> They are Moros primary, so I think it would be easier than adapting it. The Death Arcanum also has a lot of interesting applications, like manipulating shadows (like Pride does), creating things out of ectoplasm, moving stealthfully, generating cold, etc. At first glance, it seems mostly focused on ghosts, but it has a ton of utility to offer besides that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 04-16-2020, 11:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T20:35:41-07:00","id":1382050,"title":"","content":"The <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Uncrowned_King\" target=\"_blank\">Uncrowned Kings</a> might also catch your player's fancy, members of the legacy strive to perfect not just their craft but themself, something Edward Elric does throughout <i>Full Metal Alchemist</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T20:37:47-07:00","id":1382052,"title":"","content":"Obrimos have a religious undercurrent that I don't think fits with a FMA-style alchemist. Published Matter-primary legacies are very rare, and the only one for Obrimos is Transhuman Engineers which thematically are very different from FMA-style alchemists.<br /> <br /> Moros is a better fit. It's not just the alchemy part either; a lot of FMA is about the irreplaceable value of the soul, which ties into Death.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13121-galivet","name":"galivet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13121_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T23:14:20-07:00","id":1382068,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>galivet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1382045-full-metal-mage?p=1382052#post1382052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Obrimos have a religious undercurrent that I don't think fits with a FMA-style alchemist. Published Matter-primary legacies are very rare, and the only one for Obrimos is Transhuman Engineers which thematically are very different from FMA-style alchemists.<br /> <br /> Moros is a better fit. It's not just the alchemy part either; a lot of FMA is about the irreplaceable value of the soul, which ties into Death.</div> </div> </div> </div>While don\u2019t disagree that Moros is good fit, Obrimos do love their mathematical precision and natural laws. There is a lot of scientific perspective baks into their 2e description, which is in no small part because real-world alchemy was both mysticism and science. While I\u2019m not the most well versed on FMA, my gut instinct is that both Paths work well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}